1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,633
Day two. You find the main kitchen.
Steel counters. Pots on hooks. A
hundred thousand cans.

2
00:00:06,133 --> 00:00:08,100
The buffet! Dinner is on me. Ha.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,433
One can has a tiny bulge. Like it took
a deep breath.

4
00:00:11,933 --> 00:00:16,367
Rule five. Never eat from a bulging
can. Not even if you're starving.

5
00:00:16,867 --> 00:00:22,800
A swollen can can mean bacteria making
gas inside. One of them makes a toxin
that stops your muscles.

6
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:27,000
I was going to eat that. I'm taking it
back, I was never going to eat that.
